        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Guy Davis, Guillermo del Toro, Burn Gorman, Callum Greene, Jon Jashni, Thomas Tull, Matthew Robbins\n- Films: Pacific Rim, Crimson Peak, The Dark Knight Rises\n- TV Series: Torchwood, Game of Thrones, Turn\n- Roles: Dr. Owen Harper, Karl Tanner, Phillip Stryver, Dr. Hermann Gottlieb, Major Edmund Hewlett, Mr. Holly\n\nFacts:\n- Burn Gorman played Dr. Owen Harper in the BBC series Torchwood from 2006 to 2008.\n- Burn Gorman played Phillip Stryver in The Dark Knight Rises in 2012.\n- Burn Gorman played Dr. Hermann Gottlieb in Pacific Rim in 2013.\n- Burn Gorman played Karl Tanner in the HBO series Game of Thrones from 2013 to 2014.\n- Burn Gorman played Major Edmund Hewlett in the AMC series Turn in 2014.\n- Crimson Peak is a 2015 American gothic romance film directed, co-produced, and co-written by Guillermo del Toro.\n- Crimson Peak was also co-produced by Callum Greene, Jon Jashni, and Thomas Tull, and co-written by Matthew Robbins.\n- Burn Gorman played Mr. Holly in Crimson Peak in 2015.\n- Guy Davis is best known for collaborations with director Guillermo del Toro, including the films Pacific Rim and Crimson Peak.",
